== Summary ==
All 40 pages of '''''The Rules''''', the ''Star Wars Customizable Card Game'' rulebook packed in [[Premiere Limited|Premiere]] starter decks (© 1995 Decipher Inc.; printed in Belgium by Carta Mundi), in page order at printed size (about 6.3 × 8.7 cm per page). Document page: [[Premiere starter deck rulebook]].

Source: the 20 two-page 600 dpi TIFF spreads in the folder [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15MVULZxbmcEeBmBOToMO1axiH2zLUUKW Rulebook (from Premiere Starter Deck)] of the public "SWCCG Scans" Google Drive folder (owner not shown), uploaded to Google Drive in April 2024 (file dates 21 April 2024). Preserved copy of the folder: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261112195026/https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15MVULZxbmcEeBmBOToMO1axiH2zLUUKW Internet Archive]. Each spread was cut at the spine into the 600 dpi lossless page images listed on the document page. The current version (16 November 2026, 12.7 MB) stores each page as a 400 dpi JPEG (quality 75) made from those page images, with an invisible text layer from Tesseract OCR so the PDF can be searched; the OCR text is not proofread (the proofread text is on the document page). The earlier 60.5 MB version, with 600 dpi JPEG (quality 92) pages, is kept in the file history below.

Used on [[Premiere starter deck rulebook]] and [[Rulebooks]].

